    },
    {
      "block_id": "2102.03334_p7_b28",
      "text": "In Table 5, we perform various ablations. More training\nsteps, whole word masking, and image augmentation come\nto be bene\ufb01cial, whereas an additional training objective\ndoes not help.\n",
      "bbox": [
        307.44,
        567.02,
        541.44,
        612.93
